#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:2 d4cdcc9e00c3486eb9952571d122abe3
msgid "Mapflow API guides"
msgstr "Mapflow API 指南"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:5 2c81a2b8bef74ef0b88ce4496794864b
msgid "How to run bulk processing using Mapflow API"
msgstr "如何使用 Mapflow API 运行批量处理"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:7 786b13fd9ffd4226961c319102a80bd0
msgid ""
"In case you have multiple polygons to process or update, it can be boring to"
" upload them one by one using Web or GIS user tools. In this case, you'd "
"better think of using Mapflow :ref:`Processing API`. In this example let's "
"assume we have a list of polygons indicating the populated places borders "
"and we want to extract features like \"buildings\" with Mapflow processing "
"API."
msgstr ""
"如果您有多个多边形需要处理或更新，使用 Web 或 GIS 用户工具将它们一一上传可能会很无聊。在这种情况下，您最好考虑使用 "
"Mapflow:ref:`Processing API`。在此示例中，假设我们有一个指示人口稠密地点边界的多边形列表，并且我们希望使用 Mapflow "
"处理 API 提取“建筑物”等特征。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:10 ceec4f9eb3b247df951abb459eeb7bef
msgid ""
"1. To make it more realistic let's download some populated places borders "
"for the sample area in Uzbekistan using Openstreetmap. To do this we can "
"make a query with Overpass Turbo API like this: We can use QuickOSM plugin "
"in QGIS which is very friendly when it comes to downloading a managable "
"volume of data from Openstreetmap."
msgstr ""
"1. 为了使其更加真实，让我们使用 Openstreetmap 下载乌兹别克斯坦示例区域的一些人口稠密地点边界。为此，我们可以使用 Overpass "
"Turbo API 进行查询，如下所示： 我们可以在 QGIS 中使用 QuickOSM 插件，该插件在从 Openstreetmap "
"下载可管理的数据量时非常友好。"

#: b7bd0f57380e4d34a4589ee784ba074d
msgid "quickosmm"
msgstr "快奥斯"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:22 83b4382066f84174b5924b5bbdf34212
msgid "Authorization with Mapflow token"
msgstr "使用 Mapflow 令牌进行授权"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:24 88c0695cd1c14cf49e7b7b54c3d1295a
msgid "Let's use Mapflow token for further authorization."
msgstr "让我们使用 Mapflow 令牌进行进一步授权。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:35 532abbe02e744b6dba1ff0d2595b458a
msgid ""
"Now you get your token decoded as a username and a password and use it for "
"the authorization with the requests."
msgstr "现在，您将令牌解码为用户名和密码，并将其用于请求的授权。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:38 11e1297d00b6471d9d27a413af37785b
msgid "Create the project (it's optional)"
msgstr "创建项目（可选）"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:41 7d238ab83505492882a7eb60d4eabd16
msgid ""
"It might be useful to organise your processing with the **projects**. To do "
"this create the new project with the following API method."
msgstr "使用 **项目** 组织您的处理可能会很有用。为此，请使用以下 API 方法创建新项目。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:65 bb3f203972854c35a91f7932ceb779b2
msgid ""
"Here we get the response containing the project ID, that we can use to "
"create the processings in this specific project."
msgstr "在这里，我们得到包含项目 ID 的响应，我们可以使用它来在该特定项目中创建处理。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:67 ../userguides/use_API.rst:165
#: 332d243c8ac342979173123b4bbf9692 35dc7196d4884ebcb32e4d6015360c1d
msgid "Response example:"
msgstr "响应示例："

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:77 df2122e613494dad96f8703e87da8212
msgid "See more in :ref:`Projects - API`"
msgstr "查看更多内容：ref:`项目 - API`"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:80 065468f5943c4a44aa5e01769b8b7448
msgid "Prepare AOIs for the processings"
msgstr "为处理准备 AOI"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:82 9b345d1413d64e7bb08490e8b635edc5
msgid ""
"Let's save areas of interest with the properties as a GeoJSON file as it's "
"simple and straightforward format to be used in any application or GIS "
"software. Then we open this file and create a python dictionary to loop "
"through all GeoJSON features that we are going to use as AOI geometries for "
"creating the processing. Like this:"
msgstr ""
"让我们将感兴趣的区域及其属性保存为 GeoJSON 文件，因为它是一种简单明了的格式，可在任何应用程序或 GIS "
"软件中使用。然后我们打开这个文件并创建一个 python 字典来循环遍历所有 GeoJSON 特征，我们将使用这些特征作为 AOI "
"几何图形来创建处理。像这样："

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:94 a91ed2a0da724b0eb96dd29276fcd99a
msgid ""
"Let's check if we created the data array from our file and display all the "
"features by their names. At the next step, we will use the ``name`` property"
" to define the processing. The \"name\" is optional yet it's more convenient"
" to work with the results afterwards."
msgstr ""
"让我们检查一下是否从文件中创建了数据数组，并按名称显示所有功能。在下一步中，我们将使用“name”属性来定义处理。 "
"“名称”是可选的，但之后使用结果会更方便。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:97 52f5a39d3b6f4a3abb28ffa1bb5a4e2a
msgid "Run the Processings"
msgstr "运行处理"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:99 dd0bdcd7ce044ca79de5514a42895b95
msgid ""
"Now we are ready to create the processing for each AOI using its geometry."
msgstr "现在我们准备使用每个 AOI 的几何形状来创建处理。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:123 3320a9a815a3436c85a183804d8772c9
msgid ""
"If everything was done correctly - the list of successfully created "
"processing will be displayed."
msgstr "如果一切都正确完成 - 将显示成功创建的处理列表。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:127 c06133e4158641289631a326f42777cf
msgid "Download all the results using Mapflow API"
msgstr "使用 Mapflow API 下载所有结果"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:129 1b3364a87ca94a268bc726a5bacaac44
msgid ""
"When all processings are complete you can download easily the results for "
"each one."
msgstr "当所有处理完成后，您可以轻松下载每一项的结果。"

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:131 b2566820d16e4a7190bce89cc7d326b0
msgid ""
"If you have one processing with the multiple AOIs *(by default the number of"
" AOIs in one processing is limited to 10)* you can run a single API call to "
"download the results:"
msgstr "如果您的一个处理包含多个 AOI *（默认情况下，一个处理中的 AOI 数量限制为 10）*，您可以运行单个 API 调用来下载结果："

#: ../userguides/use_API.rst:138 c4d7fe24fdae4426934ea0200ba99bdb
msgid ""
"In case of the multiple processings, you might find it useful to run the "
"small script."
msgstr "在进行多个处理的情况下，您可能会发现运行小脚本很有用。"

